Z||000000||Heisenhund||10-25-2001||05:55 PM||||Hi all,<P>A couple quick questions concerning the coolant flow through the heater system.<P>1) Which hose is the inlet to the heater core? The 5/8 or 3/4 inch hose?<P>2) On 85 & 86 V6 models, the heater return goes through a pipe that runs under the battery tray & outlets at the rear of the engine bay & from there is connected via hose to a secondary intake on the water pump. My question is this: What size is that pipe supposed to be? I have a sneaking suspicion the one installed on my 86 GT is the incorrect size.<P>Thanks,<BR>Heis<BR>||||reg||5
Z||000001||theogre||10-25-2001||07:02 PM||||No idea. <P>I just hooked mine up acording to line size when it broke. Only fits one way with factory hoses.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
